* ERASE - DELETE DISK FILES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ERASE - DELETE DISK FILES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:ERASE filespec

Deletes matching files; wildcards can select multiple files. Example on a
disposable scratch file: SYSUTLS:ERASE I0:TEST.TMP

Read the complete filespec and any confirmation prompt before agreeing.
There is no undelete guarantee. This private CP/M 3 program is separate
from resident ERA; neither is a public caller command here.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
